{"unit_id":"whklwhkl__dsh-playwright#card-zh","repo":"whklwhkl/dsh-playwright","commit":"e7ff42d8e0675ef7297f50d3b78768b47893de68","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"playwright-browser 是面向 DSH 的浏览器自动化插件，可在 DSH 工具界面中调用 Playwright 操作 Chromium。它注册打开页面、连接现有浏览器、管理标签页、点击和填写表单、读取文本或 HTML、执行页面表达式及截图等工具，并提供可按需加载的站点提示 skill。适合需要让 agent 浏览网页、提取页面信息或使用已有浏览器会话的场景。需要安装 playwright-core 并准备 Chromium，或配置现有 Chrome/Edge；可选环境变量用于截图目录、语言和 CDP 连接。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:606","lib/index.js:795","lib/index.js:826","lib/skill-provider.js:96"]}
{"unit_id":"whklwhkl__dsh-playwright#card-en","repo":"whklwhkl/dsh-playwright","commit":"e7ff42d8e0675ef7297f50d3b78768b47893de68","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"playwright-browser adds Playwright browser tools to DSH. It opens pages, interacts with controls, manages tabs, extracts text or HTML, and saves screenshots. It can attach to existing Chrome or Edge and includes an on demand site tips skill. Provide Chromium or configure an existing browser.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:606","lib/index.js:795","lib/index.js:826","lib/skill-provider.js:96"]}
